OL,3,GNEWSACouncil pursues court order over
OL,4,Aempty buildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council says it is seeking court
OL,7,Forders that will give police more
OL,8,Fpowers to tackle unauthorised access to
OL,9,Ftwo sites in Mansfield.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police issued a warning
OL,12,Fagainst young people exploring
OL,13,Fabandoned buildings after three
OL,14,Fteenagers were found on the rooftop of
OL,15,Fthe former council-owned Beales
OL,16,Fdepartment store, in Stockwell Gate.
