OL,3,GNEWSACouncil pursues court order over
OL,4,Aempty buildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the B&M supermarket
OL,7,Fbuilding in Stockwell Gate and the
OL,8,FWalkden Street car park above it, which
OL,9,Fpartially collapsed in August 2025,
OL,10,Fwere among the sites that have been
OL,11,Ftargeted by young people.
OL,13,FMansfield District Council said it was
OL,14,F"working towards" obtaining closure
OL,15,Forders for both sites to help tackle
OL,16,Funauthorised access.
